{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9cad6d0d-afd2-8f0b-979b-7630d3492cc9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T09:55:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:50:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Yeah, I'm calling about some feral cats. I think it's animal control, but I wasn't sure if I got the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place to start. I can take the details and point it to animal control. Where are the cats?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 361 Broadway, up in the North End. They're hanging around the dumpsters out back of the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:51:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "361 Broadway, okay. And is it one cat or more than one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "More than one. It's like a colony, honestly. I've counted at least five at once, maybe more. They come and go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:51:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Can you describe them for me? Size, color, anything that stands out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so the big one is wicked big, like a full-grown tom, orange and white, kind of a thick neck. Then there's a smaller gray one, skinny, and a couple of black ones that look like young ones. Totally skittish, they bolt if you get close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:52:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Orange and white male, a skinny gray one, two smaller black ones. Do any of them look hurt or sick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:52:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] The gray one maybe. Its eye looks kind of crusty. The others seem okay, just thin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:52:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll note the eye. Have you been feeding them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:52:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I mean, I think somebody is, because there's a pile of dry food by the dumpster lid sometimes. That's probably why they stick around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Did the storm last weekend have anything to do with it? Are they more visible now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:52:59-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, kind of. After the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, I saw more of them out in the open. I think they were digging around because the usual spots were soaked. Before that I only saw one or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:53:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's common. They come out looking for food and shelter after weather like that. Is the dumpster area on private property or is it shared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:53:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the building's lot. I'm the owner, so it's my property. I just don't want anybody getting hurt and I don't want the cats suffering either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:53:44-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll send this to animal control with the address, the number of cats, the descriptions, and the note about the gray one's eye. They'll likely want to talk to you about trapping or a program for managing the colony. Is this a good number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0188. You're on speaker, sorry, I'm in the truck. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:54:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Let me read it back, 401-555-0188, Gerard Lynch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. Lynch, L-Y-N-C-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Someone from animal control should call you back, probably within a few business days. If a cat is clearly injured before then, call us back and we'll flag it as more urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Should I do anything in the meantime? Like move the food or leave the dumpster lids shut?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keeping the lids closed helps, and if you can, don't leave food out. They'll give you better guidance when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. I'll do that. Honestly, I feel better just having gotten a real person on the line. I figured I'd get a menu or a voicemail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're here. Anything else I can help you with this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's everything. Thanks a lot, Rosa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:55:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lynch. Take care."
    }
  ],
